<title>USA: Guaranty National Pouliot president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Guaranty National Pouliot president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guaranty National Corp said on Tuesday it named James Pouliot president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Pouliot, who will succeed Roger Ware, has served as executive vice president and CEO-elect, the company said.</p>
<p>Guaranty said Ware was retiring but would continue to serve on the company's board of directors and act as a senior consultant to the company for two years.</p>
</text>
